            "label": "ponder.starrailexpress.label.skill",
            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "Skill \"displace\": swaps positions with the player in your line of sight, cooldown 28 seconds. After the swap you get 4 seconds of dizziness, cannot use items for 2 seconds and cannot use melee attacks for 5 seconds; the other player gains 2 seconds of speed.",
                "zh_cn": "技能错位：和视线中的玩家互换位置，冷却 28 秒。交换后获得 4 秒眩晕，且 2 秒内无法使用物品，5 秒内无法使用近战攻击。对方会获得 2 秒速度。",
                "zh_tw": "技能錯位：和視線中的玩家互換位置，冷卻 28 秒。交換後獲得 4 秒眩暈，且 2 秒內無法使用物品，5 秒內無法使用近戰攻擊。對方會獲得 2 秒速度。"
